What's new in this beta:
• "This month" is now called "Tus gastos" (Your expenses).
• Analysis: tap a category or a payment method to see the expenses behind its amount, with date, name and amount.
• Clearer note in "By category": it includes the monthly share of what you pay every few months.
• The update notice is now a yellow card that is easier to spot, with a download progress bar.
Your data stays on your phone only.
